{"4199840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Steelarchy", "steam_appid": 4199840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/5fc57b0ea5febc5702fbd30eacb3a1ef.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/5fc57b0ea5febc5702fbd30eacb3a1ef.avif?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steelarchy</strong> is a high-stakes, single-player 3rd-person vehicle combat roguelike. <br>Pilot a custom armored vehicle through a vast, rocky wasteland dominated by a machine collective called Steelarchy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/8ad700359bcb7c60439aa5e2388e3d22.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/8ad700359bcb7c60439aa5e2388e3d22.webp?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy machines are a coordinated hive mind, If one unit spots you, the entire force enters a coordinated hunt,  <br>The <strong>Fortress</strong> is the central spawning hub, it changes its color every match, shifting the enemy's strength and strategy.<br>Steelarchy isn't static. It scales its numbers and aggression in real-time based on how much of a threat you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/114d8b0e4af8a65962e716d5760d5970.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/114d8b0e4af8a65962e716d5760d5970.avif?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep customization meets tactical choices. Every vehicle uses a three-layer system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perks:</strong> Weapon, Movement, and Armor buffs that charge while you fight and move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brainwaves:</strong> Powerful active abilities. The more you equip, the more the machines hate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Affixes:</strong> Permanent passive stats that form the backbone of your machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/130c807c7f9d3df9d548af38670dd898.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/130c807c7f9d3df9d548af38670dd898.avif?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span>Your combat style dictates your power through the <strong>Protocol</strong>, a Brain - Machine balance value that shifts dynamically during the match, Using Brainwave abilities increase Protocol level, accelerates your cooldowns while Relying on Perks decreases Protocol level, speeds up your weapon, movement, and armor charges. Mastering this flow is the difference between a successful extraction and a total wreck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/4447b7b3c0dcb8db57806edd5c08e713.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/4447b7b3c0dcb8db57806edd5c08e713.webp?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge a procedural map for resources and trade with mysterious map elements for temporary power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four extraction gates are your only way out. Reach one to secure 100% of your loot. If you are destroyed or forced to retreat, the Steelarchy reclaims 50% of everything you gathered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/3bdc2ae5ac722d4701504680321c3022.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/3bdc2ae5ac722d4701504680321c3022.webp?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span>Spend your hard-earned Workshop resources to buy new parts, modify your builds, and prepare for the next hunt,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/5fc57b0ea5febc5702fbd30eacb3a1ef.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/5fc57b0ea5febc5702fbd30eacb3a1ef.avif?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steelarchy</strong> is a high-stakes, single-player 3rd-person vehicle combat roguelike. <br>Pilot a custom armored vehicle through a vast, rocky wasteland dominated by a machine collective called Steelarchy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/8ad700359bcb7c60439aa5e2388e3d22.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/8ad700359bcb7c60439aa5e2388e3d22.webp?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy machines are a coordinated hive mind, If one unit spots you, the entire force enters a coordinated hunt,  <br>The <strong>Fortress</strong> is the central spawning hub, it changes its color every match, shifting the enemy's strength and strategy.<br>Steelarchy isn't static. It scales its numbers and aggression in real-time based on how much of a threat you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/114d8b0e4af8a65962e716d5760d5970.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/114d8b0e4af8a65962e716d5760d5970.avif?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep customization meets tactical choices. Every vehicle uses a three-layer system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perks:</strong> Weapon, Movement, and Armor buffs that charge while you fight and move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brainwaves:</strong> Powerful active abilities. The more you equip, the more the machines hate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Affixes:</strong> Permanent passive stats that form the backbone of your machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/130c807c7f9d3df9d548af38670dd898.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/130c807c7f9d3df9d548af38670dd898.avif?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span>Your combat style dictates your power through the <strong>Protocol</strong>, a Brain - Machine balance value that shifts dynamically during the match, Using Brainwave abilities increase Protocol level, accelerates your cooldowns while Relying on Perks decreases Protocol level, speeds up your weapon, movement, and armor charges. Mastering this flow is the difference between a successful extraction and a total wreck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/4447b7b3c0dcb8db57806edd5c08e713.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/4447b7b3c0dcb8db57806edd5c08e713.webp?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge a procedural map for resources and trade with mysterious map elements for temporary power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four extraction gates are your only way out. Reach one to secure 100% of your loot. If you are destroyed or forced to retreat, the Steelarchy reclaims 50% of everything you gathered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras/3bdc2ae5ac722d4701504680321c3022.avif?t=1787134528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/extras_big/3bdc2ae5ac722d4701504680321c3022.webp?t=1787134528 width=1560 height=520 /></span>Spend your hard-earned Workshop resources to buy new parts, modify your builds, and prepare for the next hunt,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Steelarchy is a 3rd-person vehicle combat roguelike centered on deep loadouts. Face off against a modular fortress of rigid steel in explosive, chaotic battles. With deep meta-progression and shifting enemy tactics, no two matches are the same. Build. Customize. Upgrade. Embrace the carnage.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/ea7d96a6fbe4d4b07f3f529921d6e07e8e01ec01/header.jpg?t=1787134528", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/11eaaa8489294e8777aa77e6b972eb9d5872503c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787134528", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199840/11eaaa8489294e8777aa77e6b972eb9d5872503c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787134528", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 5600 / Intel i5-11400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 6600 (8GB) / RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 9 6900HX / Intel i7-13700H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 6850M XT (12GB) / RTX 4070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Fragment Labs"], "publishers": ["Fragment Labs"], "demos": [{"appid": 4388340, "description": ""}], "package_groups": 